  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Aligns LibreWinForms 0.1.0-preview.30 with immutable LibreWPF 0.1.0-preview.30 and ProGPU 0.1.0-preview.28; builds unchanged .NET WinForms template projects through LibreWinForms.Sdk without requiring a Windows TFM; preserves hosted double-click counts for Project Explorer and designer interactions; keeps MenuStrip, ToolStrip, context menus, and dropdowns correctly positioned and interactive; inherits typed X11/XWayland positioning, movement, popup, and dispatcher-pump fixes; and retains the bounded-memory, text, image, and scene-performance improvements from the previous preview.",
